CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:
#1
Project:

2018 Traffic Signal Installation Project (Bid No. S-7-18)
Project Number:

Contract # 6793
Contractor:

W.L. Contractors, Inc.
Date Prepared:

May 10, 2018

The above referenced contract is amended or modified as set forth in the following and these
amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the parties. All other
aspects of the original agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.

I. Description of Changes

After the project was bid, the contractor was informed by their signal pole supplier that due to tariff
issues and a competitor going out of business, estimated timelines on pole deliveries are being
extended from 8 weeks after shop drawing approval to 17-24 weeks after shop drawing approval.
We have subsequently been informed that the poles for this project are now scheduled to ship from
the factory on August 21 (18 weeks).  This unexpected delay in delivery of a key component is in
turn effecting the entire project schedule.

II. New Contract Items

None

III. Schedule

The contract completion date is being extended from August 31 to October 19, 2018.

IV. Summary
